# Party banter, the earned one: Madoc hands a dead man to the song.
# Gated on Madoc's affinity (the trigger def carries the condition).
dialogue TSC_Banter_GilleVerse

== start ==
Madoc says it out of nowhere, to the fire rather than to anyone.

Madoc: Put Gille in the song. He'd have hated it. That's rather the point.

Wren sets down the lute the way you put down something that might spill.

Wren: Give me one true thing about him and I'll do it properly.

* [Listen.] -> verse

== verse ==
Madoc: He complained. Beautifully. It was how he loved things.

There is a quiet in which somebody feeds the fire.

Wren: That's a verse. That's the whole verse, Madoc.

* [Leave them to it.] -> end
